      {
        "action": "replace",
        "decision_id": "D000939",
        "disposition": "existing_equivalent",
        "rationale": "Stacks now constructs all Grothendieck spectral sequences supplied by the two equivariant Hom factorizations (5.6.4) and (5.6.5): the three global sequences were integrated earlier, while the new module-valued comparison and acyclicity lemma gives the remaining sheaf sequence from higher invariant direct images of ordinary sheaf Ext to equivariant sheaf Ext. This exactly closes the source's p. 215 composite-functor assertion; the separately numbered p. 218 sequences IV and V are not included.",
